[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ふう。やっとひと段落ついたな……あれは……？）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bg": "00003",
    "bgm": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030090010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "se": "0118",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": -200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 700
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ、プロデューサーさんっ！\r\nこんにちは！　お仕事中ですか？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、終わったから事務所に戻るところだったんだ\r\n果穂はどうしたんだ？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "下校中ですっ！　あ、でも掃除当番で遅くなっちゃったから\r\n家じゃなくて、そのまま事務所に行こうと思ってます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか\r\nじゃあ、一緒に行こうか",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！\r\nえへへ、プロデューサーさんと一緒でうれしいです",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺もうれしいよ\r\n今日は、学校で何があったんだ？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "朝から、友達とテレビの話をしてました\r\nみんな、ヒーローはあんまり見てないんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020040"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でもでもっ、ここがカッコいいとか面白いって、\r\nお話したら、興味を持ってくれたみたいで！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020050"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "今度あたしのお家に集まって、\r\nヒーローの名シーン特集を見るんですよ！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは楽しみだな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。あと、今日の給食はカレーライスでした\r\nとっても美味しかったです",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020070"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でもつい食べすぎちゃって\r\nその後の体育は、いつもより動けませんでした……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは\r\nまあ、次頑張ればいいさ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　……くしゅん！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ん？　なんだか様子が……）",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "果穂、もしかして体調悪くないか？\r\n大丈夫か……？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……え？　大丈夫ですよ？\r\nあたしは元気ですっ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（ちょっと様子がおかしいな……）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日は事務所に寄らずに、帰った方がいいと思う\r\n元々、ちょっとした予定だけだったしな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えっ？　どうしてですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは……",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "熱があるんじゃないか\r\nと思って",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "疲れがたまってるか\r\nと思って",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "select": "マメ丸に会いに\r\n行きたいから",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "熱、ですか？　うーん、自分ではよくわからないです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020120"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、確かめてみてくださいっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "off",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん。やっぱり ちょっと熱いな\r\n微熱程度かもしれないが……",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、自分で気づかなかったのに……\r\nスゴいですっ、プロデューサーさん！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020140"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんは、あたしのこと……\r\nよく見てくれてるんですね。えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、もっと早く気づけたら良かったんだが……\r\nとにかく今日は帰ろう",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルはハードスケジュールだからな\r\n休める時にしっかり休んでおいたほうがいい",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そっか……ヒーローだって、\r\nいっつも戦ってるわけじゃないですもんね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。さあ、家へ帰ろう\r\n送っていくよ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ありがとうございますっ\r\nじゃあ今日はゆっくり休んで……また明日、頑張りますっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020170"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "うーん……\r\n自分では、そんな感じしないですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近は少しずつアイドルの仕事も増えてきたし……\r\n学校も毎日ちゃんと通ってるんだろう？",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい。でも、ぜんぜん大変じゃないですよ？\r\nお仕事も学校も、大好きですからっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは何よりだ……でも疲れてるんなら\r\n無理はしちゃいけない",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これからもっとアイドルとして成長できるように、\r\n今日はしっかり休むべきだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "成長するために、休む……なるほど！\r\n全然思いつきませんでした！　そんな考え方もあるんですね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020200"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんはやっぱりオトナで、スゴいですね！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことはないさ\r\nそれじゃあ今日は、もう家に帰ろうか",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい、わかりました！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020220"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！　これからもたくさん、\r\nあたしにアドバイスしてくださいねっ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020230"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わあっ！　本当ですか？　そういえば、\r\nまだ一度も会ったことなかったですね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。だから果穂を送るついでに、\r\nマメ丸と会えたら、と思ってな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "それはすごくうれしいんですけど……でも\r\n事務所でお仕事の話があったんじゃないですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "仕事の話なら、歩きながらでもいい\r\n別に、事務所じゃなくてもできるさ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わかりました\r\nじゃあ、あたしの家まで案内しますねっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、頼んだよ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ。こうやって、プロデューサーさんと\r\n家まで一緒に歩くなんて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020270"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ、なんだか新鮮で楽しいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020280"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうだ、お父さんとかお母さんにしてもらうみたいに、\r\n手をつないでてもいいですか？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ？　俺は、かまわないが……",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ！　わあっ……プロデューサーさんの手って、\r\n大きいんですね。なんだか落ち着きます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900302/2009003020300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うれしそうな笑顔だな……\r\n今のこの時間が、いい気分転換になるといいな）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]